      <div type="clause" n="6.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Rect">Rect</ref> 6.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">On manegum landum stent þæt he sylle ælce geare . xv . swyn to sticunge . x. ealde . 7.v. gynge . hæb|be sylf þæt he ofer þæt arære .</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">On many estates [the custom] stands that he gives each year fifteen pigs for slaughter, ten mature and five young. He has [for] himself [any] that he rears over that [amount].</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">[6.1] On manegum landum stent, þæt he sylle ælce geare XV swyn to sticunge, X ealde 7 V gynge – hæbbe sylf, þæt he ofer þæt arære –; on manegum landum byreð deopre swanriht.</ab>
      </div>
